              </LONG-NAME>
              <DESC>
                <L-2 L="EN">The function Fls_BlankCheck shall verify, whether a given memory area has been erased but not (yet) programmed. The function shall limit the maximum number of checked flash cells per main function cycle to the configured value FlsMaxReadNormalMode or FlsMaxReadFastMode respectively.</L-2>
              </DESC>
              <SERVICE-ID>12</SERVICE-ID>
